Cut 2026-10-16 on Anthony's word ("Cut 0.85.0 now"). A minor carrying #747 to #761 (#750 a design record only):
- #754: the Inference record and its check;
- #757: the axioms a conclusion rests on;
- #760: proof status and who confirmed each step;
- #761: the line-of-reasoning read-back, objections that count as far as they hold, and Decision.status contested;
- #755: mathematics' words for reflow2's types;
- #759: served text asking for an inference chain behind a consequential recommendation;
- #749: a person picks a merge's survivor;
- #751, #752, #753: the deprecation registry and the Anchor type's announcement;
- #748: the site republished from main;
- #756, #758: everyday builds without RocksDB and fewer test programs;
- #747: re-blessed 0.84.0's surface record.

199 tools (197 in 0.84.0); the two new are add_inference and reasoning_report. The stamp moves: one node type (Inference), two edge types (PREMISE_OF, CONCLUDES), and Decision.status gains contested. Measured at the cut with the published 0.84.0 binary: it refuses a store 0.85.0 has opened, even a plain one, and refuses 0.85.0's export (docs/upgrading-to-v0.85.0.md). The Anchor type is deprecated, and Alex is told before the tag. Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Xbw6PG9mXJiU2Sb421fnq
